From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 21:51:15 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] AMLCapture: hold the screen image while no picture comes

A continuous screen reader got nothing from a mode set until the
reopened stream's first frame, and nothing while vdin dropped the
blank frames of a muted output. Over a second of that made the
ambilight feeder drop its source. With the vdin change, a blank input
raises a source change event and reports no signal.
---
